Dissociation constants for the physiological nucleotide substrates and products have been measured and are as
follows: NADPH, 0.87 &micro;M; NADP<sup>+</sup>, 16 &micro;M; NADH, 50 &micro;M;
and NAD<sup>+</sup>, 100-500 &micro;M [<a href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/15935988">Bizouarn05</a>].
